B.a14=new A.cd("Focal aware seizure","Focal","A focal seizure in which awareness is fully preserved throughout the event.",B.S1,"Focal interictal spikes/sharp waves over the corresponding cortex; the ictal discharge is often subtle on scalp EEG.","A focal aware seizure is frequently just the aura preceding a focal impaired-awareness seizure.",!1)
