B.a1k=new A.cd("Generalized tonic-clonic seizure","Generalized","Bilateral tonic stiffening followed by clonic jerking with loss of consciousness from onset. A convulsion that starts focally is classed as focal to bilateral tonic-clonic (ILAE 2017).",B.QI,"Generalized high-amplitude polyspike or spike-wave discharge; marked postictal generalized voltage attenuation.","Lateral tongue bite and prolonged postictal confusion are the two most useful bedside discriminators from PNES.",!1)
