B.a1_=new A.cd("Atonic seizure","Generalized",'Sudden loss of muscle tone causing a head nod or full collapse ("drop attack").',B.T9,"Generalized slow spike-and-wave, or a generalized electrodecremental (voltage attenuation) pattern.","Consider a protective helmet for patients with frequent atonic drop attacks.",!1)
