B.To=s(["Presyncopal prodrome: lightheadedness, tunnel vision, diaphoresis, nausea","Brief duration of jerking, usually under 30 seconds","Rapid, full recovery without prolonged postictal confusion","Situational triggers: prolonged standing, pain, venipuncture, micturition/defecation"],t.s)
